entų aptarnavime.",1],[0,"And how long have you worked in customer service?","O kiek laiko dirbate klientų aptarnavime?","dcb33a0985ec",2.69],[-1,"I worked as a sales manager in Lithuania.","Lietuvoje dirbau pardavimų vadybininku.",1],[0,"Oh, a sales manager! That's great.","O, pardavimų vadybininkas! Puiku.","28dd747a1911",3.05],[0,"How long have you worked as a sales manager?","Kiek laiko dirbate pardavimų vadybininku?","f570b528fc91",2.13],[-1,"I'm a truck driver.","Esu sunkvežimio vairuotojas.",1],[0,"Oh, a truck driver! That's great.","O, sunkvežimio vairuotojas! Puiku.","e75e36ee0803",2.49],[0,"How long have you worked as a truck driver?","Kiek laiko dirbate sunkvežimio vairuotoju?","69b1222c0e92",2.11],[-1,"I'm a sales manager.","Esu pardavimų vadybininkas.",1],[0,"Oh, a sales manager! Interesting.","O, pardavimų vadybininkas! Įdomu.","ec5eedcedeeb",3.54],[0,"And how long have you been a sales manager?","O kiek laiko esate pardavimų vadybininkas?","7a4a3ca9079e",2.04],[-1,"I worked as a baker in Lithuania.","Lietuvoje dirbau kepėju.",1],[0,"Oh, a baker! Interesting.","O, kepėjas! Įdomu.","32fa0484540d",3.13],[0,"So, why do you want to work here?","Taigi, kodėl norite čia dirbti?","7b60706bbb8c",2.17],[-1,"Your company has a great reputation.","Jūsų įmonės reputacija puiki.",1],[0,"I appreciate that.","Labai tai vertinu.","baa93314b088",1.59],[0,"So, what are your strengths?","Taigi, kokios Jūsų stiprybės?","d60dbc2e7a21",1.94],[-1,"People say I'm a team player.","Žmonės sako, kad esu komandos žaidėjas.",1],[0,"Good, because we work in teams a lot here.","Gerai, nes čia daug dirbame komandose.","7ddb732d57c1",2.95],[0,"And what about weaknesses?","O kaip dėl silpnybių?","306e20824272",1.7],[-1,"I can be a little impatient.","Kartais būnu truputį nekantrus.",1],[0,"Okay, thank you for sharing that.","Gerai, ačiū, kad pasidalijote.","b8000b632203",1.9],[0,"So, where do you see yourself in five years?","Taigi, kur save matote po penkerių metų?","03f6cbeb83ea",2.82],[-1,"I'd like to lead a team.","Norėčiau vadovauti komandai.",1],[0,"That sounds great.","Skamba puikiai.","7a81cb222706",1.35],[0,"And if we offer you the job, when could you start?","O jei pasiūlysime Jums darbą, kada galėtumėte pradėti?","68225dead415",2.88],[-1,"I can start next Monday.","Galiu pradėti kitą pirmadienį.",1],[0,"Perfect.","Puiku.","2b5bae531de3",1],[0,"Do you have any questions for me?","Ar turite man klausimų?","db51ff7182e7",1.64],[-1,"I'm good, thanks. And you?","Gerai, ačiū. O Jums?",1],[0,"Anytime!","Visada prašom!","ec465674b103",1.1],[0,"I like that.","Man tai patinka.","317c475d1f9b",0.77],[0,"Thank you so much for your time today.","Labai ačiū, kad šiandien skyrėte laiko.","b070dc3edeaa",2.12],[0,"We'll be in touch in a few days.","Susisieksime per kelias dienas.","0dfee49d3e07",2.12],[0,"Good morning! Can I help you?","Labas rytas! Kuo galiu padėti?","2b6386fea919",1.67],[-1,"I'm here for an interview.","Atvykau į darbo pokalbį.",1],[0,"Great! And your name, please?","Puiku! O kaip Jūsų vardas?","56ee631c2d58",1.94],[-1,"I'm Tomas Mikalauskas.","Aš Tomas Mikalauskas.",1],[0,"Nice to meet you! I'm the HR manager here.","Malonu susipažinti! Aš čia personalo vadovė.","aeac8504f79d",2.71],[0,"Come in and have a seat.","Užeikite ir prisėskite.","c3d2ff00cbfd",1.51],[0,"So, tell me a little about yourself.","Taigi, papasakokite truputį apie save.","6baa1f7c6439",2.23],[-1,"I moved here two months ago.","Atsikrausčiau čia prieš du mėnesius.",1],[0,"Oh, welcome!","O, sveiki atvykę!","316e2002c954",1.4],[0,"Just tell me a little about yourself: your work and your experience.","Tiesiog truputį papasakokite apie save: apie savo darbą ir patirtį.","277514c2eef9",3.5],[-1,"I have ten years of experience in manufacturing.","Turiu dešimties metų patirtį gamyboje.",1],[0,"Wow, that's a lot of experience!","Oho, tai daug patirties!","968fc068cca4",2.57],[0,"Why do you want to work at Brightline?","Kodėl norite dirbti „Brightline“?","f03ac4285c35",2.1],[-1,"I'd like to use my experience here.","Norėčiau čia panaudoti savo patirtį.",1],[0,"That's great to hear.","Malonu girdėti.","2ddf715797ec",1.1],[0,"What are your greatest strengths?","Kokios Jūsų didžiausios stiprybės?","1e5ca3db78a7",1.96],[-1,"I'm organized, and I learn fast.","Esu organizuotas ir greitai mokausi.",1],[0,"We love organized people here!","Čia labai mėgstame organizuotus žmones!","f1acbb91c48e",2.33],[0,"And your weaknesses?","O Jūsų silpnybės?","f7c4df4e266c",1.47],[-1,"Sometimes I take on too much.","Kartais prisiimu per daug darbų.",1],[0,"I appreciate your honesty.","Vertinu Jūsų atvirumą.","d61a0c98f48e",1.9],[0,"What languages do you speak?","Kokiomis kalbomis kalbate?","eeb3979eb70d",1.47],[-1,"I speak Russian and English.","Kalbu rusų kalba ir anglų kalba.",1],[0,"That's great! That could be really useful here.","Puiku! Čia tai galėtų būti labai naudinga.","6b93c1a12030",2.8],[0,"And what salary are you looking for?","O kokio atlyginimo tikitės?","210a195d83bd",2.11],[-1,"Around fifty thousand a year.","Apie 50 000 dolerių per metus.",1],[0,"Okay, that's helpful. Thank you.","Gerai, tai naudinga. Ačiū.","0f747faa8513",2.41],[0,"So, what questions do you have for me?","Taigi, kokių klausimų turite man?","6cd5fad768fb",1.99],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[0,"Well, thank you so much for coming in today.","Na, labai ačiū, kad šiandien atvykote.","48aa71505ef1",2.5],[-1,"It's Tomas Mikalauskas.","Tomas Mikalauskas.",1],[0,"Would you like some water or coffee?","Ar norėtumėte vandens ar kavos?","0e7a2d969349",1.86],[-1,"No, I'm good, thanks.","Ne, man nereikia, ačiū.",1],[0,"Okay, sure.","Gerai.","f56789d7082d",1.14],[0,"So, tell me about yourself.","Taigi, papasakokite apie save.","5656f7cfe172",1.98],[-1,"I'm an accountant with ten years of experience.","Esu buhalteris, turiu dešimties metų patirtį.",1],[0,"That's a lot of experience!","Tai daug patirties!","6fc847bd5752",2.08],[-1,"I really like your company.","Man labai patinka Jūsų į